  "Google SRE's autonomy table lists L1 Assisted as automation for the first two stages with humans handling the remaining three, L2 Partial as automation in the first two stages plus one later stage (the fourth column) with humans handling the rest, and L3 High as automation in the first four stages with a human handling only the last.": 1,
  "Google agents advance to L3 or L4 only for specific, well-bounded scenarios after sustained, statistically significant success rates against human-verified Golden evaluation data.": 1,
